Contour (contour-design)
A Rust rewrite of OpenDesign (https://github.com/nexu-io/open-design), Copyright nexu-io and contributors, Apache License 2.0.
Content in content/ (skills, design-templates, design-systems, craft…) comes from OpenDesign commit e03d5c2; each subdirectory keeps its original LICENSE file where one exists.

Copied content (git archive at e03d5c2, git-tracked files only):
- content/craft/            13 files (11 craft entries + README.md + FUTURE_SECTIONS.md)
- content/skills/           169 directories
- content/design-templates/ 115 directories
- content/design-systems/   152 packages + _schema; brand names and attribution kept per docs/decisions.md §3
- 73 nested LICENSE files kept in place.

Excluded or not yet copied:
- Fonts: the 4 directories above contain no font files (.woff/.woff2/.ttf/.otf/.eot), so nothing had to be excluded.
- prompt-templates/: see M6 below.
- plugins/_official/ examples, image/video-templates, design-systems: not yet copied.
  When copying examples/, exclude the unlicensed fonts (examples/open-design-homepage/assets/fonts) and the hashed fonts in video-templates/*/source/fonts.

Test data: crates/od-content/tests/fixtures/original-*.json is the output of the original TypeScript loader (Apache-2.0) run over the content/ above.

M2 (run engine), from OpenDesign commit e03d5c2 (Apache-2.0):
- crates/od-runtime/tests/fixtures/claude-cli-recordings/: 6 real stdout recordings of Claude Code 2.1.259 + README, copied verbatim from apps/daemon/tests/fixtures/claude-cli-recordings/.
- crates/od-runtime/tests/fixtures/codex/turn-exec-json.jsonl: a `codex exec --json` recording, copied from apps/daemon/tests/fixtures/codex-app-server/.
